  "notes": "Labels use GPIO names from the diagram callouts with the CircuitPython name first in functions. STEMMA QT callouts in this image pair SCL with GPIO2 and SDA with GPIO3 (opposite of the right-header SCL=GPIO3 / SDA=GPIO2); transcribed as printed. USB Type A host connector (USB_HOST_DATA_PLUS/MINUS, USB_HOST_5V_POWER), BUTTON, NEOPIXEL and NEOPIXEL_POWER skipped. Battery connector included because its pins are labeled."
